Windows, so packed layers extract by @WynandVStaden in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1617\n* Add cache disk slots, so one checkpoint can be restored with a different cache mounted for each machine by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1621\n* Bump version to 1.25.2 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1623\n* Mount a restored cache slot only into the machine's own containers by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1624\n\n## New Contributors\n* @0xprames made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1612\n* @WynandVStaden made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1617\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.25.1...v1.25.2","mentions_count":3}
